{"title":"Gifted programs","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The following is a list of <b>Gifted programs</b> and organizations that run gifted programs.  Many summer programs and websites are listed seperately (See also at the bottom of the this page).\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gifted_schools_programs\">Gifted schools programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Gifted schools programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a> (AoPS) hosts this <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPSWiki\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPSWiki\">AoPSWiki</a>.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/\">AoPS Homepage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talent_Development\" title=\"Center for Talent Development\">Center for Talent Development</a> (CTD) at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Northwestern_University\" title=\"Northwestern University\">Northwestern University</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ctd.northwestern.edu/\">Homepage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth\" title=\"Center for Talented Youth\">Center for Talented Youth</a> (CTY) at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Johns_Hopkins_University\" title=\"Johns Hopkins University\">Johns Hopkins University</a>.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://cty.jhu.edu/\">Homepage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Davidson_Institute&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Davidson Institute (page does not exist)\">Davidson Institute</a> is dedicated to helping young scholars develop their talents.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ditd.org/\">Homepage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Duke_University_Talent_Identification_Program\" title=\"Duke University Talent Identification Program\">Duke University Talent Identification Program</a> (Southeastern U.S.) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.tip.duke.edu/\">Homepage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=EPGY\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"EPGY\">EPGY</a> hosts an assortment of gifted programs.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://epgy.stanford.edu/\">Homepage</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_education\" title=\"Gifted education\">Gifted education</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_websites\" title=\"Gifted websites\">Gifted websites</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_summer_programs\" title=\"Academic summer programs\">Academic summer programs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_mathematics\" title=\"Gifted mathematics\">Gifted mathematics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_academics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Gifted academics (page does not exist)\">Gifted academics</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018032203\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 15/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser f